{{!
    @template mod_playercross/inactive_words

    Teacher-only warning listing approved pool words missing from one or both of the
    two roles a word can play — term or theme concept — shown on view.php outside
    and above the game card — not below it, so it can never end up hidden behind the
    mobile virtual keyboard, which is position: fixed to the viewport's bottom edge
    and therefore has no reserved space of its own for content that would otherwise
    render after it; and not nested inside the card, since the card is
    width: fit-content and a long word list here has no line-break opportunity in
    that calculation, which would otherwise force the whole card wide. Never
    rendered for a student — gated by canmanage in view_page_service.php.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "activewordscountterm": "5 words active as a term.",
        "activewordscounttheme": "6 words active as the theme concept.",
        "inactivewordstitle": "Inactive words in this game:",
        "hasnotterm": true,
        "nottermtext": "Not used as a term (2): iluminismo, revolucao.",
        "hasnottheme": true,
        "notthemetext": "Not used as the theme concept (1): café-com-leite."
    }
}}
<div class="mod-playercross-inactive-words alert alert-warning mb-3">
    <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{activewordscountterm}}</strong></p>
    <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{activewordscounttheme}}</strong></p>
    <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{inactivewordstitle}}</strong></p>
    <ul class="mb-0">
        {{#hasnotterm}}
            <li>{{nottermtext}}</li>
        {{/hasnotterm}}
        {{#hasnottheme}}
            <li>{{notthemetext}}</li>
        {{/hasnottheme}}
    </ul>
</div>
